<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>About Us | Unlim Tailor</title>
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="luxury-banner position-relative mb-5">
		<picture>
			<source media="(min-width: 992px)"
					srcset="/image/whss1checimg.png">
			<source media="(min-width: 576px)"
					srcset="/image/whss1checimg.png">
			<img src="/image/whss1checimg.png"
				 class="img-fluid w-100"
				 alt="Bespoke Tailoring">
		</picture>
		<!-- Overlay + Content -->
		<div class="position-absolute top-50 start-50 translate-middle text-center text-white px-3"
			 style="width:100%;">
			<p class="fs-4 fw-light">
				We don’t wish to have too many customers,<br>
				but we try our best to have customers for life
			</p>
			<a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-light mt-3 px-4">
				MAKE AN APPOINTMENT
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
    <section class="our-story">
        <div class="story-container">
            <div class="story-image">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594932224826-94b2724242ee?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=800" alt="Suit Detail">
            </div>
            <div class="story-text">
                <h2>OUR STORY.</h2>
                <h3>UNLIM TAILOR: DEFINING CONTEMPORARY ELEGANCE.</h3>
                <p>BORN FROM A PASSION FOR PERFECT FIT AND UNCOMPROMISING STYLE, WE BLEND SAVILE ROW CRAFTSMANSHIP WITH MODERN INNOVATION.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars">
        <div class="section-title">OUR PILLARS</div>
        <div class="pillars-grid">
            <div class="pillar-item">
                <div class="icon-container">
                    <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M4 19L19 4M19 4C20.1046 4 21 4.89543 21 6C21 7.10457 20.1046 8 19 8C17.8954 8 17 7.10457 17 6M19 4V10M17 6H13" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                        <path d="M7 16V10M11 16V12M15 16V14" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h4>1. PRECISION CRAFT</h4>
                <p>Tailoring built on dedication.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="pillar-item">
                <div class="icon-container">
                    <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M4 18V6C4 4.89543 4.89543 4 6 4H10M4 18V20C4 21.1046 4.89543 22 6 22H18C19.1046 22 21 21.1046 21 20V18M4 18H21M20 4H14M14 4V10M14 4C14 4.89543 14.8954 6 16 6C17.1046 6 18 4.89543 18 4M10 4V8M10 4C10 3 9 2.5 8 2.5C7 2.5 6 3 6 4" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h4>2. MODERN FIT</h4>
                <p>Designed for the way you move.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="pillar-item">
                <div class="icon-container">
                    <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                        <path d="M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H19C20.1046 4 21 4.89543 21 6V10M3 10V18C3 19.1046 3.89543 20 5 20H19C20.1046 20 21 19.1046 21 18V10M3 10H10M21 10H14M10 10V16M14 10V16M7 4V2M11 4V2M15 4V2M19 4V2" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                        <path d="M6 14L8 14" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <path d="M6 16L8 16" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <path d="M16 14L18 14" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" />
                        <path d="M16 16L18 16" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h4>3. UNLIMITED CUSTOMIZATION</h4>
                <p>Your vision, limitless choices.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
        <h2>READY TO DEFINE YOUR STYLE?</h2>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
            <button class="btn-primary">BOOK A CONSULTATION</button>
            <button class="btn-secondary">EXPLORE COLLECTIONS</button>
        </div>
    </section>
	@section Styles {
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/contact.css" />
	}
</body>
</html>